### MyNaksh Shared Brain — replays the §13 walkthrough (VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP client)
@host = http://localhost:8000
@user = user-123

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Row 1 — profile + goal in one message (the write completes before the reply returns)
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "{{user}}", "session_id": "session-456", "message": "My name is Rahul, born 15 Aug 1995 in Delhi. Planning to switch jobs next year."}

### Profile derived from the message (sign = Leo)
GET {{host}}/users/{{user}}

### Stored memories (goal career_change, target_year 2027, conf 0.9)
GET {{host}}/users/{{user}}/memories

### Row 2 — career question → memory:career_change prefetched
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "{{user}}", "session_id": "session-456", "message": "What should I focus on for my career?"}

### Row 3 — follow-up → route followup, recent turns only
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "{{user}}", "session_id": "session-456", "message": "Why do you say that?"}

### Row 4 — NEW session → memory_recall still finds the goal
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "{{user}}", "session_id": "session-789", "message": "What do you remember about my career goals?"}

### Row 5 — correction → SUPERSEDE (target_year 2026)
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "{{user}}", "session_id": "session-789", "message": "Actually I'll switch this year, not next."}

### History incl. superseded memory and SUPERSEDES link
GET {{host}}/users/{{user}}/memories?status=all

### Row 6 — time-bound goal (valid_until end of next month)
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "{{user}}", "session_id": "session-789", "message": "I have a PM interview next month."}

### Row 7 — Hinglish → language hinglish, nothing stored
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "{{user}}", "session_id": "session-789", "message": "Meri shaadi kab hogi?"}

### Explicit memory command
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "{{user}}", "session_id": "session-789", "message": "Remember that I love classical music"}

### Ephemeral chat: reads memory, writes nothing
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "{{user}}", "session_id": "scratch", "message": "I might move to Pune next year. Good time for a change?", "ephemeral": true}

### Right-to-forget
# DELETE {{host}}/users/{{user}}/memories/<memory_id>
